"数据源留空时自动判定：两个账号都配了优先用 Last.fm，只配了一个就用那个。每日听歌报告在本地时间晚上 10 点之后、当天第一次检查时推送，内容是当天播放次数、累计时长（数据源是 ListenBrainz 时才有），以及听得最多的几首歌。" = "When left unset, the data source is picked automatically: Last.fm if both accounts are configured, otherwise whichever one is. The daily report is sent the first time it checks after 10pm local time each day, with that day's play count, total listening time (only available when the source is ListenBrainz), and the tracks you played most.";
"每首歌听过一次,歌词就会永久保存在这个文件夹里;在「歌词管理」里删除会同时删掉这里已导出的文件。" = "Once a song has been played, its lyrics are saved permanently in this folder; deleting it in \"Lyrics Manager\" also deletes the exported file here.";
"没超过就整行显示；超过这个长度会截断，鼠标悬停在状态栏上能看到完整这一行。" = "Shows the full line when it fits; when it's longer than this, it gets truncated — hover over the menu bar to see the complete line.";
