"这会删除当前全部 %d 条本地记录,包括你手动编辑、联网搜索采纳过的内容,已导出到本地的歌词文件也会一并删除,且无法撤销。下次播放会重新走一遍匹配解析。" = "This deletes all %d cached records, including anything you've hand-edited or adopted from an online search. Any lyrics files already exported locally will also be deleted, and this can't be undone. The next playback will re-run matching from scratch.";
"这首歌带逐字时间轴,播放时优先用它渲染——下面直接改「歌词(LRC)」文本框不会生效。如需手改主歌词,请先点「移除逐字时间轴」。译文/罗马音编辑不受影响,随时生效。" = "This song has word-by-word timing, which takes priority during playback — editing the \"Lyrics (LRC)\" text box below won't take effect. To hand-edit the main lyrics, first click \"Remove Word Timing\". Editing the translation or romanization isn't affected and takes effect right away.";
